    "take_text": "Kimi K3 just beat Fable 5 at a third of the price. Now, this was for one specific benchmark, and you have to remember that AI models have very specific domains for which they are better. Now, in this case, Kimi K3 is fantastic as front-end design, and you have to remember that Fable is the most expensive model that you can have in terms of price per token. So if you're someone who is running a lot of designs, using Kimi K3 is now a completely viable option that is not only going to get you similar results, but it's also going to cut your build by 66%. Now follow for more AI news videos and tutorials on how you can set all of this up each and every single day. See you in the next one.",
